Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4c7c2fd0-f330-3a55-ad83-320e2b9eb63d.xml</text>
